  "title": "GAUSSIAN FLUCTUATIONS OF JACK-DEFORMED RANDOM YOUNG DIAGRAMS",
  "authors_raw": "MACIEJ DO\u0141 \u02dbEGA AND PIOTR \u015aNIADY",
  "title_lines": [
   "GAUSSIAN FLUCTUATIONS",
   "OF JACK-DEFORMED RANDOM YOUNG DIAGRAMS"
  ],
  "abstract": "We introduce a large class of random Young diagrams which can be regarded as a natural one-parameter deformation of some classi- cal Young diagram ensembles; a deformation which is related to Jack polynomials and Jack characters. We show that each such a random Young diagram converges asymptotically to some limit shape and that the \ufb02uctuations around the limit are asymptotically Gaussian.",
